<& /page/page_title.mas, title=>"<i>Petunia axillaris</i> 草圖基因組序列 v1.6.2(<i>Petunia axillaris</i> draft genome sequence v1.6.2)" &>

<p>
  <i>Petunia axillaris</i>（Petunia hybrida 的祖先之一）的草圖基因組序列已公開發布（Bombarely 等人，2016）。P. axillaris N 基因組定序是結合短讀段（Illumina；深度 137X）與長讀段技術（PacBio；深度 22X）採用混合從頭組裝完成的。(A draft sequence of the <i>Petunia axillaris</i> genome, one of the ancestors of Petunia hybrida, is publicly available (Bombarely et al, 2016).
  The P. axillaris N genome sequence, was performed using a hybrid de novo assembly with a combination of short read (Illumina; coverage 137X) and long read technologies (PacBio; coverage 22X))<br>
</p>


<p>
  <i>Petunia axillaris</i> 基因組數據可透過 BLAST、JBrowse 和 SGN VIGS 工具在 SGN 上存取，並可從 SGN FTP 網站下載。(The <i>Petunia axillaris</i> genome data are accessible on SGN through BLAST, JBrowse and the SGN VIGS Tool, and they can be downloaded from the SGN ftp site.)
</p>

